                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Source: City of Toronto Open Data, 311 Service Requests, 2023 to 2025 (Open Government Licence - Toronto).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#4A5B6C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  1,351,594 requests, cleaned in SQL (about 8% of rows needed repair) and summarised monthly into 295,239 rows.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#4A5B6C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Star schema: one fact table with Date, Division, Request type and Status dimensions. Measures are written in DAX.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#4A5B6C"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "•  Totals reconcile with the SQL results: yearly counts, open share by division and the 58.2% renamed-type share.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9.5pt",
                      "color": "#4A5B6C"
                    }
